    <string name="settings_scale_title">Interface scale</string>
    <string name="settings_scale_text">Smaller means more room for windows. Saved separately for the phone screen and for DeX / a monitor. Under each option: the screen size in points, like a desktop resolution. Applies at once; terminals and Linux programs stay open.</string>
